{"id":"109f4d56499c2ceb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-moorefamily.md","title":"Pure Horn false points and Moore families","display":"thm-moorefamily — Pure Horn false points and Moore families","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-moorefamily","aliases":["27-thm-moorefamily"],"display":"thm-moorefamily — Pure Horn false points and Moore families","depends_on":["[[27-df-purehorn]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-thm-hornchar]]","[[27-thm-hornpurechar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-moorefamily"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-moorefamily</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-moorefamily — Pure Horn false points and Moore families"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd6815db60d4efdb\" href=\"?note=cd6815db60d4efdb\" title=\"27-thm-hornpurechar\">27-thm-hornpurechar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> is a set of sets.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}\">\\(\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}\\)</span> is the predicate to be defined on set families.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_f\\coloneqq\\{\\{i\\in[n]:a_i=1\\}:a\\in F(f)\\}\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P([n])\\land[n]\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(\\bigcap\\mathcal G\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr),\n\\qquad\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}(\\mathcal F_f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_f\\coloneqq\\{\\{i\\in[n]:a_i=1\\}:a\\in F(f)\\}\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P([n])\\land[n]\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(\\bigcap\\mathcal G\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr),\n\\qquad\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}(\\mathcal F_f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地直接推论。来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Theorem 6.3; §6.3, Theorem 6.6，印刷页 272;278，PDF 第 296;302 页（从 1 计数）。 旧版本错误使用 TRUE family；已按原书迁移为 FALSE family。support 与 Moore 谓词均在 Assertion 中内建定义，避免无来源符号和 Hypothesis 偷藏新定义。证明是 meet 对应集合交，再加 all-one 假点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornpurechar","status":"resolved","id":"cd6815db60d4efdb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornpurechar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $F(f)$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-truefalse]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $F(f)$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-truefalse]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_f\\coloneqq\\{\\{i\\in[n]:a_i=1\\}:a\\in F(f)\\}\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P([n])\\land[n]\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(\\bigcap\\mathcal G\\in\\mathcal F)\\bigr),\n\\qquad\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Moore}_{[n]}(\\mathcal F_f)).","display":true}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-478","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-moorefamily|thm-moorefamily — Pure Horn false points and Moore families]]"}],"outgoing":["a42b2c2b11efeb04","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","584eb5a4dd07e7fb","cd6815db60d4efdb","5d10aed668d85817"]}